OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAElectricity discount to be given
OL,4,Ato NI households
OL,5,
OL,6,FAll households in Northern Ireland will
OL,7,Fget a one-off #63 reduction in
OL,8,Felectricity bills from next month.
OL,10,FIt is the local outworking of two
OL,11,Fschemes which apply in Great Britain,
OL,12,Fwhich has a separately regulated
OL,13,Felectricity market.
OL,15,FThe schemes are being funded by the UK
OL,16,Fgovernment and will be applied
OL,17,Fautomatically without the need for an
OL,18,Fapplication.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,417,410,260,120,0,100
