OL,3,GNEWSAElectricity discount to be given
OL,4,Ato NI households
OL,5,
OL,6,FBank payment customers will have their
OL,7,Fbills automatically reduced while
OL,8,Fpay-as-you-go customers will receive
OL,9,F#63 in credit when they top up their
OL,10,Fmeter.
